Chibukai

771
00:10:57,250 --> 00:11:01,380
Fansub!

772
00:10:57,250 --> 00:11:01,380
Patada al estómago a la velocidad del mar.

773
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:58,670
¡Kaisoku!

774
00:10:59,380 --> 00:11:01,180
¡Harakudashigeri!

775
00:11:06,130 --> 00:11:07,640
¡Gyojin Karate...

